DATA IS NOT COVERED BY THE LICENCE ABOVE

The MIT licence covers the code in this repository. The files under data/
were retrieved from third parties and remain subject to their own terms.

  Air quality (data/raw/openmeteo_air_*.json)
      Copernicus Atmosphere Monitoring Service (CAMS), served through
      Open-Meteo. Open-Meteo data is CC BY 4.0. Contains modified
      Copernicus Atmosphere Monitoring Service information; neither the
      European Commission nor ECMWF is responsible for any use of it.

  Weather and historical forecast (data/raw/openmeteo_weather_*.json,
  data/raw/openmeteo_forecast_*.json)
      ERA5 and the Open-Meteo historical forecast archive, served through
      Open-Meteo, CC BY 4.0.

  Ground stations (data/raw/air4thai_current.json)
      Air4Thai, Pollution Control Department, Ministry of Natural Resources
      and Environment, Thailand.

  Fire detections
      NASA FIRMS, VIIRS and MODIS active fire products, courtesy of NASA
      Earthdata. Attribution requested, no redistribution restriction.

Anyone reusing the data files should credit these sources, not this
repository.
